---
layout: layout.njk
permalink: /
title: blog
description: Essays on agent architecture and production LLM systems.
---
<section class="home-hero">
  <h1 class="home-brand">blog</h1>
  <p class="home-lede">Essays on agent architecture—identity, observations, side channels, and knowing when to stop.</p>
</section>

<section class="essay-list" aria-label="Essays">
  <ol>
    {% for essay in collections.essays %}
    <li>
      <a class="essay-list-item" href="{{ essay.url | url }}">
        <span class="essay-list-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ essay.fileSlug | essayNumber }}</span>
        <span class="essay-list-body">
          <span class="essay-list-title">{{ essay.data.title }}</span>
          <span class="essay-list-excerpt">{{ essay.data.description }}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
